  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Lang Ya land spirit calls for immortal methods against Feng Jiu Ge, Fourth Hair answers with Third Hair. Fourth Hair’s immortal killer move creates a golden qi spiral above Heavenly Giant Solor’s head; the currents shoot toward Feng Jiu Ge, gather around him, and leave him unable to shrug them off.",
      "chapters": [
        1541
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_third_hair",
        "sys_heavenly_giant_solor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Sixth Hair, Third Hair, Seventh Hair, and the other hairy man Gu Immortals, Fourth Hair enters Long Hair Ancestor’s refinement path formation under Lang Ya land spirit to refine myriad self Immortal Gu for Fang Yuan. After the second refinement step, Lang Ya land spirit and others rest while Fourth Hair and Sixth Hair sustain the formation and carve the solidified rock into fragments. When that work is done, Fourth Hair and Sixth Hair rest while Third Hair continues the next steps.",
      "chapters": [
        1570
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "myriad-self-refinement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_sixth_hair",
        "char_seventh_hair",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_long_hair_ancestor",
        "gu_myriad_self_immortal_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Lang Ya land spirit again leads the Long Hair refinement path formation for myriad self Immortal Gu, Fourth Hair enters after the land spirit, together with Third Hair, Sixth Hair, Seventh Hair, and the other Gu Immortals, with Fang Yuan last.",
      "chapters": [
        1756
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
